  "description": "SQLDBEntityNotifier is a comprehensive .NET library for database change tracking notifications across SQL Server, MySQL, and PostgreSQL. It provides event-driven notifications for insert, update, delete, and error scenarios, supporting advanced Change Data Capture (CDC) features with minimal configuration. Features include multi-database support, column-level filtering, change analytics, schema change detection, and real-time monitoring. Easy to use, well-documented, and fully unit tested with 379+ test cases.",
