  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.0 - Advanced CDC Features: Multi-database support (SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL), Column-level filtering, Change analytics and metrics, Schema change detection, Change correlation engine, Advanced routing and filtering, Change replay and recovery, Real-time monitoring, Comprehensive test coverage (379+ tests), Full documentation and examples.",
